{"id":"n33c85a704c","headline":"Explainer-What is the yen carry trade?","summary":"The yen surged to a seven-month high, prompting investors to ask whether the yen carry trade is ending. The trade has been a pillar of global markets.","why":"The yen carry trade involves borrowing cheaply in yen to invest in higher-yielding assets, so a stronger yen can force position unwinds across markets.","category":"markets","event_type":"capital","importance":3,"flag":null,"market_moving":true,"location":{"place":"Tokyo","country":"Japan","lat":35.68,"lon":139.69,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"93.3 The Drive","url":"https://www.933thedrive.com/2026/09/09/explainer-what-is-the-yen-carry-trade-2/"},"sources":[{"name":"93.3 The Drive","url":"https://www.933thedrive.com/2026/09/09/explainer-what-is-the-yen-carry-trade-2/"}],"published_at":"2026-09-09T05:18:47Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-12T06:29:12Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"c5dd81a14b2194ff","impacts":[],"why_moved":"The yen's surge to a seven-month high raised concerns that the yen carry trade, a major source of global funding, could be unwinding.","backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-12T06:29:12Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-09-09T05:18:47Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-09-09T06:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"JA","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/banknotes-money-1963184.jpg","alt":"banknotes money (illustration)","credit":"stevepb","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/money-laundering-crime-fighting-1963184/"}}